  Description: Your unbelievable training grants you mental resiliency. Your proficiency
    rank for Will saves increases to legendary. When you roll a success at a Will
    save, you get a critical success. When you roll a critical failure at a Will
    save, you get a failure instead. When you roll a failure on a Will save against
    a damaging effect, you take half damage.
